    {
      "rank": 0,
      "embedding_idx": 3,
      "text": "I can't use this app even I am a Korean. Not worth it. Asking for all kind of permission and access."
    },
    {
      "rank": 1,
      "embedding_idx": 1,
      "text": "해외인데 핸드폰번호 인증이 안돼네요.. 한국번호야만 가능한지? 국가번호란도 없고. Can't do the mobile number verification.. plus, the T&C contents and the verification instructions in Korean would not be comprehensible for non-Korean speakers."
    },
    {
      "rank": 2,
      "embedding_idx": 4,
      "text": "Without membership, it's not moving to next step and during registration of membership, I didn't receive any code to verify the mobile number."
    },
    {
      "rank": 3,
      "embedding_idx": 0,
      "text": "한국사람이어도 해외에 살아서 한국 핸드폰 없으면 인증 못해서 사용 못하네요. 그럴꺼면 왜 해외계정에서 다운받을 수 있게 해놓은거죠? Waste of my time when baby is crying and needed a baby crying analysis. To use this app you need a Korean mobile to register. Dont waste your time downloading and trying to get this work.0"
    },
